#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Gym/scripts.inc:106
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Gym_Text_GymGuideAdvice"
msgid ""
"Yo, how's it going?\p"
"Listen, my friend!\n"
"Would you like to become the CHAMPION?\p"
"I'm no TRAINER, not me, but I can\n"
"sure give you winning advice.\p"
"That's settled, then! We'll aim for the\n"
"POKéMON CHAMPIONSHIP together!\p"
"It's your job as a TRAINER to collect\n"
"GYM BADGES, am I right?\p"
"But GYM LEADERS aren't pushovers!\p"
"And that's where I come in!\n"
"I'm here to provide expert advice!\p"
"ROXANNE, the GYM LEADER, is a user\n"
"of ROCK-type POKéMON.\p"
"The ROCK type is very durable, but\n"
"it can't stand WATER-type and\l"
"GRASS-type moves.\p"
"Come see me afterwards, if you beat\n"
"the GYM LEADER.\p"
"Well, go for it!$"
msgstr ""
"哟，最近怎么样？\p"
"听我说，朋友！\n"
"你想成为冠军吗？\p"
"我不是训练家，\n"
"不过我能给你致胜的建议。\p"
"那就这么说定了！\n"
"我们一起朝着宝可梦冠军努力吧！\p"
"收集道馆徽章是训练家的使命，\n"
"我说得没错吧？\p"
"可是道馆馆主们可不好对付！\p"
"所以就轮到我出场了！\n"
"我会给你专业的建议！\p"
"道馆馆主杜娟\n"
"使用的是岩石属性的宝可梦。\p"
"岩石属性非常结实，\n"
"但是很怕水属性\l"
"和草属性的招式。\p"
"如果你打败了道馆馆主，\n"
"之后再来找我吧。\p"
"好了，加油吧！$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Gym/scripts.inc:128
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Gym_Text_GymGuidePostVictory"
msgid ""
"Whoa! What a breathtaking victory!\n"
"My cheering must've worked!\p"
"Great!\n"
"Check your TRAINER CARD.\p"
"The STONE BADGE you got should be\n"
"properly recorded on it.\p"
"In other words…\p"
"You've climbed the first step on\n"
"the stairs to the CHAMPIONSHIP!\p"
"That's got to feel awesome!$"
msgstr ""
"哇！真是一场精彩的胜利！\n"
"一定是我的加油起作用了！\p"
"太好了！\n"
"看看你的训练家卡片吧。\p"
"你得到的原石徽章\n"
"应该已经记录在上面了。\p"
"换句话说……\p"
"你已经踏上了\n"
"通往冠军之路的第一级台阶！\p"
"这感觉一定很棒吧！$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Gym/scripts.inc:140
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Gym_Text_JoshIntro"
msgid ""
"Don't take us GYM TRAINERS lightly!\n"
"I'll show you why we're better!$"
msgstr ""
"别小看我们道馆的训练家！\n"
"我会让你知道我们有多厉害！$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Gym/scripts.inc:144
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Gym_Text_JoshDefeat"
msgid "You were too good for me…$"
msgstr "你太强了……$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Gym/scripts.inc:147
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Gym_Text_JoshPostBattle"
msgid ""
"You haven't seen anything of the ROCK\n"
"type's terrifying power!$"
msgstr ""
"你还没见识到岩石属性\n"
"真正可怕的力量呢！$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Gym/scripts.inc:151
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Gym_Text_TommyIntro"
msgid ""
"If you can't beat me, you won't stand\n"
"a chance against ROXANNE!$"
msgstr ""
"要是连我都打不赢，\n"
"你就别想赢过杜娟了！$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Gym/scripts.inc:155
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Gym_Text_TommyDefeat"
msgid "Wow! You've got some potential!$"
msgstr "哇！你很有潜力嘛！$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Gym/scripts.inc:158
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Gym_Text_TommyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"ROXANNE is stronger than me by\n"
"several times.\p"
"You'd better be on your guard!$"
msgstr ""
"杜娟比我强好几倍。\p"
"你可要小心了！$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Gym/scripts.inc:163
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Gym_Text_MarcIntro"
msgid ""
"We might be in the middle of town,\n"
"but so what?\p"
"My ROCK POKéMON need room to\n"
"rampage!$"
msgstr ""
"虽然这里是城市中心，\n"
"那又怎么样？\p"
"我的岩石宝可梦\n"
"需要大闹一场的空间！$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Gym/scripts.inc:169
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Gym_Text_MarcDefeat"
msgid ""
"Oh, man oh man!\n"
"Our challenger is one feisty customer!$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀呀呀！\n"
"这个挑战者可真够厉害的！$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Gym/scripts.inc:173
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Gym_Text_MarcPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I have to hand it to our LEADER.\p"
"It took smarts and sense for her to\n"
"pick the ROCK type at her young age.$"
msgstr ""
"我真是佩服我们的馆主。\p"
"她年纪轻轻就选择了岩石属性，\n"
"真是又聪明又有眼光。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Gym/scripts.inc:178
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Gym_Text_RoxanneIntro"
msgid ""
"Hello, I am ROXANNE, the RUSTBORO\n"
"POKéMON GYM LEADER.\p"
"I became a GYM LEADER so that I might\n"
"apply what I learned at the POKéMON\l"
"TRAINER'S SCHOOL in battle.\p"
"Would you kindly demonstrate how you\n"
"battle, and with which POKéMON?$"
msgstr ""
"你好，我是卡那兹市\n"
"宝可梦道馆的馆主杜娟。\p"
"我是为了把在宝可梦训练家学校\n"
"学到的东西运用到对战中，\l"
"才成为道馆馆主的。\p"
"能不能请你展示一下，\n"
"你会用什么宝可梦、怎样对战呢？$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Gym/scripts.inc:187
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Gym_Text_RoxanneDefeat"
msgid ""
"So…\n"
"I lost…\p"
"It seems that I still have much more\n"
"to learn…\p"
"I understand.\p"
"The POKéMON LEAGUE's rules state\n"
"that TRAINERS are to be given this\l"
"if they defeat a GYM LEADER.\p"
"Please accept the official POKéMON\n"
"LEAGUE STONE BADGE.$"
msgstr ""
"这么说……\n"
"我输了……\p"
"看来我需要学习的东西\n"
"还有很多……\p"
"我明白了。\p"
"根据宝可梦联盟的规定，\n"
"打败道馆馆主的训练家\l"
"可以得到这个。\p"
"请收下宝可梦联盟\n"
"正式认证的原石徽章。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Gym/scripts.inc:199
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedStoneBadge"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} received the STONE BADGE\n"
"from ROXANNE.$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}从杜娟那里\n"
"得到了原石徽章。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Gym/scripts.inc:203
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Gym_Text_StoneBadgeInfoTakeThis"
msgid ""
"The STONE BADGE heightens the ATTACK\n"
"power of your POKéMON.\p"
"It also enables them to use the HM move\n"
"CUT outside of battle.\p"
"Please take this with you, too.$"
msgstr ""
"原石徽章能提高\n"
"你的宝可梦的攻击。\p"
"还能让宝可梦在对战以外\n"
"使用秘传招式居合斩。\p"
"这个也请你带上吧。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Gym/scripts.inc:210
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Gym_Text_ExplainRockTomb"
msgid ""
"That TECHNICAL MACHINE, TM39,\n"
"contains ROCK TOMB.\p"
"It not only inflicts damage by dropping\n"
"rocks, it also lowers SPEED.\p"
"If you use a TM, it instantly teaches\n"
"the move to a POKéMON.\p"
"Remember, a TM can be used only once,\n"
"so think before you use it.$"
msgstr ""
"这个招式学习器39里\n"
"是岩石封锁。\p"
"它不仅能扔下岩石造成伤害，\n"
"还能降低对手的速度。\p"
"使用招式学习器，\n"
"就能立刻让宝可梦学会招式。\p"
"记住，招式学习器只能使用一次，\n"
"使用前要好好考虑。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Gym/scripts.inc:220
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Gym_Text_RoxannePostBattle"
msgid ""
"Since you are so strong, you should\n"
"challenge other GYM LEADERS.\p"
"By battling many TRAINERS, you should\n"
"learn many things.$"
msgstr ""
"你这么强，\n"
"应该去挑战其他的道馆馆主。\p"
"和很多训练家对战，\n"
"你一定能学到很多东西。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Gym/scripts.inc:226
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue"
msgid "RUSTBORO CITY POKéMON GYM$"
msgstr "卡那兹市宝可梦道馆$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Gym/scripts.inc:229
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Gym_Text_GymStatueCertified"
msgid ""
"RUSTBORO CITY POKéMON GYM\p"
"ROXANNE'S CERTIFIED TRAINERS:\n"
"{PLAYER}$"
msgstr ""
"卡那兹市宝可梦道馆\p"
"杜娟认可的训练家：\n"
"{PLAYER}$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Gym/scripts.inc:234
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Gym_Text_RoxanneRegisterCall"
msgid ""
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … Beep!\p"
"ROXANNE: Oh, hello, {PLAYER}?\n"
"This is ROXANNE of RUSTBORO CITY.\p"
"I heard from BRAWLY that you're\n"
"moving up through the ranks of\l"
"TRAINERS at an incredible clip.\p"
"Well, I'd rather not think that\n"
"I can't beat you.\p"
"I promise, I will shape up my GYM\n"
"so that you may challenge us again.\p"
"I hope you'll be looking forward to\n"
"that occasion as much as me!\p"
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … Click!$"
msgstr ""
"…… …… ……\n"
"…… …… 哔！\p"
"杜娟：喂，你好，是{PLAYER}吗？\n"
"我是卡那兹市的杜娟。\p"
"我听藤树说，你在训练家之中\n"
"以惊人的速度不断变强。\p"
"不过，我可不想认为\n"
"自己赢不了你。\p"
"我保证，我会好好整顿我的道馆，\n"
"让你能再来挑战我们。\p"
"希望你也和我一样\n"
"期待着那一天！\p"
"…… …… ……\n"
"…… …… 咔嚓！$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Gym/scripts.inc:251
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Gym_Text_RegisteredRoxanne"
msgid ""
"Registered GYM LEADER ROXANNE\n"
"in the POKéNAV.$"
msgstr ""
"在宝可导航中\n"
"登记了道馆馆主杜娟。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Gym/scripts.inc:255
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Gym_Text_RoxannePreRematch"
msgid ""
"ROXANNE: I'm so glad to see you again.\n"
"I'm ROXANNE, the GYM LEADER here.\p"
"I'm sure we've both experienced many\n"
"battles since we last met.\p"
"I would like to see how much better\n"
"we've become. Let us battle!$"
msgstr ""
"杜娟：真高兴能再见到你。\n"
"我是这里的道馆馆主杜娟。\p"
"自从上次见面以后，\n"
"我们一定都经历了很多对战。\p"
"我想看看我们都进步了多少。\n"
"来对战吧！$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Gym/scripts.inc:263
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Gym_Text_RoxanneRematchDefeat"
msgid ""
"Grr…\n"
"Again, I have lost…$"
msgstr ""
"唔……\n"
"我又输了……$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Gym/scripts.inc:267
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Gym_Text_RoxannePostRematch"
msgid ""
"ROXANNE: I still have much to learn\n"
"when it comes to battling POKéMON.\p"
"That awareness makes me love battling\n"
"all that much more!$"
msgstr ""
"杜娟：在宝可梦对战方面，\n"
"我还有很多要学习的东西。\p"
"正因为意识到了这一点，\n"
"我才更加喜欢对战了！$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Gym/scripts.inc:273
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Gym_Text_RoxanneRematchNeedTwoMons"
msgid ""
"ROXANNE: I'm so glad to see you again.\n"
"I'm ROXANNE, the GYM LEADER here.\p"
"I'm sure we've both experienced many\n"
"battles since we last met.\p"
"I would like to see how much better\n"
"we've become…\p"
"Oh, no…\n"
"You only have one POKéMON with you?\p"
"Please return with at least one more\n"
"POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"杜娟：真高兴能再见到你。\n"
"我是这里的道馆馆主杜娟。\p"
"自从上次见面以后，\n"
"我们一定都经历了很多对战。\p"
"我想看看我们都进步了多少……\p"
"哎呀……\n"
"你只带了1只宝可梦吗？\p"
"请至少再多带1只宝可梦\n"
"回来吧。$"
